  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the dog as the guilty party",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the dog in the top panel, which is visually portrayed with a smug, satisfied expression and is associated with the text 'the cat slipped and fell into the toilet'. This implies the user is identifying with or imagining themselves as the dog, taking on the role of the one who caused the accident or is falsely blamed for it. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'dog' and the TextualMaterial 'text_chunk_1', which together form the blame_scene. The user is not explicitly deictic (e.g., 'me', 'you'), but the humor and narrative structure of the meme invite the user to adopt the dog's perspective or to see themselves as the dog in this false narrative of blame.",
